    "Check the imported wording and structure before saving. Review and save do not contact the source again. Saving keeps the final source URL and bounded JSON-LD metadata locally, including fields not shown here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "base" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Check the imported wording and structure before saving. Review and save do not contact the source again. Saving keeps the final source URL and bounded JSON-LD metadata locally, including fields not shown here."
          }
        },
        "es-MX" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Revisa el texto y la estructura importados antes de guardar. La revisión y el guardado no vuelven a contactar el origen. Al guardar se conservan localmente la URL final y los metadatos JSON-LD limitados, incluso los campos que no se muestran aquí."
          }
        },
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vérifiez le libellé et la structure importés avant d’enregistrer. La révision et l’enregistrement ne contactent pas de nouveau la source. L’enregistrement conserve localement l’URL finale et les métadonnées JSON-LD limitées, y compris les champs non affichés ici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
